  instructionKey: WallJump
  instructionLines:
  - Stuck between walls? Press [LeftShift + Space] to wall jump!
  - Run up walls like a ninja! Hold [LeftShift], then tap [Space]!
  - 'Bounce off that wall: [LeftShift + Space] does the trick!'
  - Use [LeftShift] to grip, then [Space] to soar!
